WEBVTT

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.820
It's such lovely weather for a day out!

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.450
Kuru, kuru!

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:11.380
Oh, where are you girls headed today?

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:12.320
Miss!

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:13.720
Hello!

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.900
We're off to the amusement park!

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:21.500
Well, that's a relief! If you're off enjoying yourselves the day before school starts,

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.060
you must have all your summer homework done!

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:30.300
And here was I thinking I might have to hold some remedial classes if people forgot!

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.510
I'll see you at the opening assembly, then!

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:34.340
Until then, Miss.

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:42.020
Is something the matter? You appear to be trembling quite badly...

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.130
