00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:54.410
It totally slipped my mind...

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:56.500
...but today's the last day of the summer break!

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.100
No way! There's gotta be more time, right?

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.630
I'm not ready for this!

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:02.050
You know what this means?

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:03.770
Back home to hit the homework.

00:01:05.990 --> 00:01:07.340
Kuru?

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:09.620
There's something on the ground here-kuru!

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:10.900
Oh, that's a die.

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:12.420
What's that?

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:14.650
You play games by rolling it...

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:37.070
Where on earth <i>are</i> we...?

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:43.500
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.330
Smile Precure!

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:46.230
Let's go!

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:47.770
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:48.900
All together!

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:50.500
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:52.710
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:55.380
Smile Precure!

00:01:57.240 --> 00:02:00.210
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:05.650
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:10.860
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:16.800
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:21.740
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:21.700
So bright!

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:26.910
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:33.350
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:33.850
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:35.020
Let's go!

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:37.720
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:40.650
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:45.460
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:46.030
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:47.700
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:48.830
Everybody!

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:50.500
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:53.030
Fly to the future!

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:56.540
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:58.710
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:58.710 --> 00:03:01.010
Smile Precure!

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:18.750
Where are we...?

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:21.170
We were in the park just now...

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:24.010
It's gone! Where's it gone-da wasa?!

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:26.730
Who cares about some stupid die?

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:28.060
Yeah-oni!

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.350
It's very important to me-da wasa!

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:32.490
Of course.

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:34.750
Coulda guessed it was her fault.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:36.750
Excuse me!

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:38.650
Why are the Precure here?!

00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:45.700
The Precure found my die for me! How very convenient-da wasa!

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:51.070
You see, that's no ordinary die! That's my very own Gameilator-da wasa!

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:57.040
When you roll the dice, you're sucked into this amazing game world and made to play my games-da wasa!

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:59.310
We get to play games?!

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:00.760
That sounds awesome!

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:01.560
Hey, you two!

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:03.900
We've still gotta do our homework!

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:06.180
I command you return us to our world!

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:13.060
If you don't transform and beat all my games by half past six, you'll be stuck here forever-da wasa!

00:04:13.070 --> 00:04:14.360
So, what'll it be?

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:16.160
