00:04:16.180 --> 00:04:17.430
Come on, you four!

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:17.930
Right!

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:23.040
Ready?

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:26.330
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:27.520
Go!

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:29.720
Go, go!

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:31.380
Let's go!

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:02.770
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:06.030
Cure Happy!

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:10.510
Dazzling sun!

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:12.510
Hot-blooded power!

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:15.260
Cure Sunny!

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:21.190
