00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:24.010
Cure Peace!

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:29.500
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:32.800
Cure March!

00:05:35.030 --> 00:05:38.760
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:41.510
Cure Beauty!

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:46.330
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:05:52.110 --> 00:05:56.290
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:02.160
You better put up a good fight-da wasa!

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:04.730
She could be layin' us a trap, ya know.

00:06:04.730 --> 00:06:06.470
