00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:27.260
I'll do it, I'll do it! I'm good at whack-a-mole!

00:06:27.260 --> 00:06:27.790
Hey!

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:30.660
You're up, Cure Happy?

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:34.260
Whoever hits the most in one minute is the winner-da wasa!

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:35.130
Okay!

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:37.530
