00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:43.890
Yeah, well my technique's tried and true. Burn rubber!

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:47.680
A.

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:48.730
Kan.

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:49.730
Be!

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:53.870
Go get him, Sunny!

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:55.840
You ain't beatin' me!

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:57.540
