00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:30.800
Well, she seems up for it, so what's the harm?

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:33.410
I'll go first-oni!

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:34.380
Go!

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:39.910
