00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:46.940
That's three games, three wins so far!

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:49.040
Won't take us long to reach the goal like this!

00:11:49.280 --> 00:11:54.080
I think you ought to be keeping a closer eye on the time, personally-da wasa!

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:58.800
