00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:08.030
If we don't hurry up, we're gonna run out of time!

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:13.080
Yes, time does tend to fly when you're having fun-da wasa!

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:15.410
