00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:16.710
Yeah-oni!

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:25.680
Beauty!

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:32.590
Candy!

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:35.840
We've gotta get through these games!

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:37.580
And fast!

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:42.290
Stage 4 is baseball-oni!

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:47.230
It's very simple! You just have do is score one simple hit to win-oni!

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:49.360
Score a hit, huh.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:52.060
