00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:55.630
I predict three strikes-oni!

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:57.880
Throw down the gauntlet!

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.410
With courage blazing!

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:02.370
The only thing I'll be throwing is right past you-oni!

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:07.380
