00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:20.810
Alright, let's keep this up!

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:22.530
Skiing!

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:24.190
Weightlifting!

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:25.640
Painting!

00:15:25.640 --> 00:15:27.260
Table tennis!

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:28.520
Old maid!

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:31.820
And now...

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:36.560
You've done well to reach the pinnacle here-da wasa!

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:39.570
And in the nick of time, too!

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:41.800
Shall we begin the finale-da wasa?

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:45.770
Come forth, Super Akanbe!

00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:50.710
Super Akanbe!

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:53.850
The final stage is simply... riding the ferris wheel-da wasa.

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:55.420
Riding the ferris wheel?

00:15:55.420 --> 00:16:01.750
All you have to do is do a full loop in the ferris wheel and say you're "ultra happy" at the end-da wasa.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.820
Ultra happy?

