00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:12.230
Let's do it!

00:16:16.610 --> 00:16:18.500
Yay, it's like we're flying-kuru!

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:19.370
This is exciting!

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:21.850
