00:16:56.710 --> 00:17:01.210
Human children spend their summer holidays each year playing about and having fun.

00:17:01.230 --> 00:17:06.990
And as it draws to an end, they panic, remembering all the homework they should have been doing all along-da wasa.

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:11.780
So, by pulling the Precure into my game world at that exact moment...

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:14.920
...it'll stop them doing their homework-oni!

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:19.100
And then we show them just how stupid they've been this whole time!

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:24.870
Why didn't I do my homework?!

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:29.440
I shouldn't have been readin' mangas all day!

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:35.020
But how could I resist?!

00:17:35.020 --> 00:17:36.550
And shoot!

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:40.620
I kept saying I'd do it tomorrow...

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.920
We're done for...

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:44.850
They're losing heart-kuru!

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:46.990
Please, everyone, snap out of it!

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:59.140
Ultra poopy...

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.500
It seems victory is mine-da wasa!

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:03.710
Hooray!{TLC: ヽ( ゜▽゜)ﾉ}

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:05.710
I'm ultra <i>happy</i>-kuru!

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:08.950
I, too, am ultra happy.

00:18:08.950 --> 00:18:10.850
Cure Beauty...

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:14.390
You're quite correct. They spent far too much time playing about during the holidays.

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:18.290
But I do not believe that fun is necessarily a waste of time.

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:21.030
It is, in fact, one of the greatest forms of education!

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:25.430
They've so far failed to finish their homework through no one's fault but their own.

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:29.000
But they can reflect on that, and be more studious in the future.

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:33.940
There may be very little time left, but there is still hope!

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:36.040
You think they can finish it in time-da wasa?

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:38.760
Do you think you can?

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:42.380
I would be more than glad to assist.

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:45.150
You'll help us with it?

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:47.420
Beauty's the smartest girl in our year!

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:52.220
And she's a really patient teacher!

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:53.820
She's good at explaining stuff, too!

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:56.160
Beauty's all the help we need!

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:57.810
We can't give up yet!

00:18:57.810 --> 00:18:58.560
Yeah!

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:00.530
Ultra happy!

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:03.500
The heck? That was a quick turnabout!

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:05.500
These brats are way too easily swayed-oni!

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:10.410
Akanbe! Just beat them up-da wasa!

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:14.510
Super Akanbe!

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:20.470
Come on! Let's finish this creep and do our homework!

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:21.120
Right!

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:26.160
I'll handle him!

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:29.010
Precure...

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:32.990
Peace...

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:34.970
Thunder!

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:38.510
Super Akanbe!

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:39.770
Akan...

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:42.270
It's blown a fuse!

00:19:45.710 --> 00:19:49.520
Pegasus, grant us your power!

00:20:03.860 --> 00:20:06.000
Princess Happy!

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:08.200
Princess Sunny!

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:10.400
Princess Peace!

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:12.610
Princess March!

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:14.810
Princess Beauty!

00:20:19.050 --> 00:20:23.000
Precure: Princess Form!

00:20:30.150 --> 00:20:33.250
May the light of hope shine!

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:36.510
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:43.390
Precure...

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:47.040
Rainbow...

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:49.530
Burst!

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:57.290
Akanbe...!

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:05.990
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:18.070
Just two more to go-kuru!

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:22.860
Yay!

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:23.520
We beat the last stage!

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:27.620
We didn't even get any Bad Energy from that!

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:29.190
What a waste of time-oni!

00:21:29.190 --> 00:21:31.740
I hate those brats-da wasa!

00:21:34.610 --> 00:21:36.760
Let's finish up this homework!

00:21:41.370 --> 00:21:43.760
Alright, girls. Your first remedial lesson.

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:45.970
Yes, ma'am...

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:48.630
Why couldn't they finish their homework...?

00:21:48.630 --> 00:21:51.840
They had far more left to do than I expected, I must admit...

00:21:52.130 --> 00:21:54.990
Reika, they're all looking at you!

00:21:54.990 --> 00:21:58.240
I suspect they merely want me to stop worrying about them.

00:21:58.640 --> 00:22:00.450
<i>Save us, Reika-chan...!</i>

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:02.190
Hey, you four! Eyes to the front!

00:22:02.190 --> 00:22:04.580
Yes, ma'am!

00:23:39.320 --> 00:23:42.280
I wish we'd gotten to do more this summer...

00:23:42.280 --> 00:23:44.280
I'd love to travel the world or somethin'!

00:23:44.280 --> 00:23:46.860
I want to go see the Statue of Liberty!

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:49.020
And I wanna run across the steppes of Mongolia!

00:23:49.020 --> 00:23:51.300
I would love to visit the Great Wall of China.

00:23:51.300 --> 00:23:54.100
I'd love to visit all those places, but... I guess I can dream.

00:23:54.100 --> 00:23:56.460
Just leave it to me-kuru!

00:23:56.460 --> 00:23:57.500
You can do that?!

00:23:58.050 --> 00:23:59.370
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.240 --> 00:24:04.570
Find your ultra happy smile!
